  "instructions": [
    "Prepare the lotus leaf wraps by brushing with coconut aminos and honey.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix together the fermented kimchi, natural yoghurt, and crushed garlic.",
    "Add the chopped mint leaves, cilantro leaves, lemongrass, salt, and black pepper to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Stir in the diced pineapple and mix well.",
    "To assemble the wrap, place the kimchi-yoghurt mixture on the center of a lotus leaf wrap.",
    "Add the chopped fresh basil leaves on top of the mixture.",
    "Fold the lotus leaf wrap over the filling, making sure to seal the edges.",
    "Cook in a steamer for 5-7 minutes or until the leaves are tender.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
  ],
